{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 157,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        162.42474365234375,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Evidence base",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.71919250488281,
        144.85211181640625,
        108.63319396972656
      ],
      "text": "PICO question",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        119.56909942626953,
        527.222412109375,
        132.71409606933594
      ],
      "text": "Could IGRA be used as an alternative to the TST, to identify individuals most at risk of progression",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        135.069091796875,
        361.3598937988281,
        148.21409606933594
      ],
      "text": "from TB infection to active TB in high TB incidence settings?",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.2271270751953,
        234.5681610107422,
        172.14112854003906
      ],
      "text": "Evidence on intervention effect",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.0770263671875,
        526.965576171875,
        196.22203063964844
      ],
      "text": "Five prospective cohort studies were identified, with a total of 7769 participants; four of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        198.5770263671875,
        526.9644165039062,
        211.72203063964844
      ],
      "text": "studies were newly identified. Three of the studies were conducted in South Africa and two in",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        214.0770263671875,
        526.9690551757812,
        227.22203063964844
      ],
      "text": "India  . The studies included PLHIV, pregnant women, adolescents, health care workers  (14–18)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.5770263671875,
        527.0142211914062,
        242.72203063964844
      ],
      "text": "and household contacts. The pooled risk ratio estimate for the TST was 1.49 (95% CI: 0.79–",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.0770263671875,
        526.8162841796875,
        258.2220458984375
      ],
      "text": "2.80), and for IGRAs was 2.03 (95% CI: 1.18–3.50). Although the estimate for IGRAs was slightly",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.969608306884766,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.5770263671875,
        527.003173828125,
        273.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "higher than that for the TST, the 95% CIs for the estimates for the TST and IGRAs overlapped",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        276.0770263671875,
        526.9590454101562,
        289.2220458984375
      ],
      "text": "and were imprecise. Furthermore, there was limited evidence for the predictive utility of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.5770263671875,
        240.71498107910156,
        304.7220458984375
      ],
      "text": "tests in specific at-risk populations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        315.73492431640625,
        167.33612060546875,
        328.64892578125
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.58489990234375,
        526.7500610351562,
        352.72991943359375
      ],
      "text": "IGRA testing is more costly than the TST and requires appropriate laboratory services. TST",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        355.08489990234375,
        526.9635009765625,
        368.22991943359375
      ],
      "text": "testing is less costly and can be performed in the field, but it requires a cold chain, two health",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.58489990234375,
        526.9796752929688,
        383.72991943359375
      ],
      "text": "care visits and training in intradermal injection, reading and interpretation. The incremental",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        386.08489990234375,
        511.23370361328125,
        399.22991943359375
      ],
      "text": "cost–effectiveness of IGRAs and the TST appears to be influenced mainly by their accuracy.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.5965270996094,
        179.01329040527344,
        427.97650146484375
      ],
      "text": "User perspective",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.2274169921875,
        527.0296020507812,
        451.3724365234375
      ],
      "text": "The preferences of people to be tested and programmes depend on several factors, such as the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972565650939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.7274169921875,
        527.1353759765625,
        466.8724365234375
      ],
      "text": "requirement for an adequately equipped laboratory (e.g. for IGRAs) and possible additional costs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.2274169921875,
        521.4080810546875,
        482.3724365234375
      ],
      "text": "for people being tested (e.g. for travel) and programmes (e.g. for infrastructure and testing).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        494.739013671875,
        275.1541442871094,
        511.1189880371094
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.369873046875,
        526.947998046875,
        534.514892578125
      ],
      "text": "Where it is feasible, TB infection testing is desirable to identify individuals at highest risk for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.869873046875,
        526.617919921875,
        550.014892578125
      ],
      "text": "developing active TB. However, it is not required in PLHIV or in household contacts aged under",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987342834472656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.369873046875,
        527.019287109375,
        565.514892578125
      ],
      "text": "5 years. In HIV-negative household contacts aged 5 years and older, and in other risk groups,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        567.869873046875,
        527.1372680664062,
        581.014892578125
      ],
      "text": "TB infection tests are recommended, but their unavailability should not be a barrier to treating",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.988444328308105,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.369873046875,
        527.2638549804688,
        596.514892578125
      ],
      "text": "people who are judged to be at higher risk. The GDG noted that the availability and affordability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.949935913085938,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        598.869873046875,
        526.9808959960938,
        612.014892578125
      ],
      "text": "of the tests could determine which TB infection test is used. Other considerations include the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        614.369873046875,
        524.4105224609375,
        627.514892578125
      ],
      "text": "structure of the health system, feasibility of implementation and infrastructure requirements.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.3739013671875,
        526.7909545898438,
        651.5189208984375
      ],
      "text": "Operational difficulties should be considered in deciding which test to use. For example, IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985790252685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        653.8739013671875,
        526.9677734375,
        667.0189208984375
      ],
      "text": "requires phlebotomy, which can be difficult, particularly in young children; they also require",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.3739013671875,
        526.92578125,
        682.5189208984375
      ],
      "text": "laboratory infrastructure, technical expertise and expensive equipment, and their sensitivity is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.8739013671875,
        526.9149780273438,
        698.0189208984375
      ],
      "text": "reduced in children aged under 2 years and PLHIV. However, only a single visit is required to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        700.3739013671875,
        526.93701171875,
        713.5189208984375
      ],
      "text": "do an IGRA test (although patients may have to make a second visit to receive the result). The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.8739013671875,
        527.0139770507812,
        729.0189208984375
      ],
      "text": "TST requires a cold chain, two health care visits and training in intradermal injection, reading",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        731.3739013671875,
        526.9469604492188,
        744.5189208984375
      ],
      "text": "and interpretation. One other practical advantage of IGRAs over the TST is that IGRAs are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.8739013671875,
        526.981201171875,
        760.0189208984375
      ],
      "text": "notsusceptible to a “booster response”, which makes a two-step approach necessary for the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        762.3739013671875,
        414.0164794921875,
        775.5189208984375
      ],
      "text": "TST in situations where reactivity to the TST has waned since infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        347.6684875488281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "3. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB infection 141",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}